Usage: ruralz bundle render [DIR] [FLAGS]

Render one Environment's one-file Bundle.

Arguments:
  DIR  Bundle directory or one-file Bundle (default .)

Flags:
  --api-version VERSION    Convert the sources to VERSION
  --effective              Print the resolved Filter Chains of --route
  --env NAME               Environment to render with (needs --environments)
  --environments FILE      Local Environment resources
  --help                   Print this help
  --output yaml|json|text  Output format (yaml or json, default yaml; with --effective or --api-version: text or json, default text)
  --output-dir DIR         Directory of the converted sources
  --output-file PATH       Write the data to PATH instead of stdout
  --route NAME             Route of --effective
